nt, simplify system integration, and bring increasingly complex platforms to market faster across AI servers, advanced compute, communication infrastructure, and industrial applications.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/lattice-lscc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LSCC 2026 Q1","e":"lscc","d":"2026-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lorenzo A. Flores","x":"So you can see that there is not a dependency on cost cutting.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/lattice-lscc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LSCC 2026 Q2","e":"lscc","d":"2026-08-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Fouad Tamer","x":"Our Compute and Communications end market reached another record revenue level, growing 18% sequentially and 83% year-over-year, driven by continued momentum in data center AI applications.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/lattice-semiconductor-lscc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LSCC 2026 Q2","e":"lscc","d":"2026-08-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Fouad Tamer","x":"Demand for Lattice solutions continue to be fueled by increasing CapEx, increasing AI content per server, expanding FPGA attach rates, rising security requirements and the shift towards more complex disaggregated architectures.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/lattice-semiconductor-lscc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LSCC 2026 Q2","e":"lscc","d":"2026-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lorenzo A. Flores","x":"One of the transitory issues referenced above is a low-margin hardware pass-through business that is not core to AMI's strategic value.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/lattice-semiconductor-lscc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LSCC 2026 Q2","e":"lscc","d":"2026-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Srinivas Pajjuri","x":"And then on the AMI, the 25%, I just want to clarify that it's 25% over $200 million because you did talk about some hardware pass-through revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/lattice-semiconductor-lscc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LSCC 2026 Q3","e":"lscc","d":"2026-11-02","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Ford Tamer","x":"Finally, let me update you on the recent launch of four joint Lattice AMI solutions for streaming rack boot, security retrofit, plug-and-play deployment, and power and cooling management.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/03/lattice-lscc-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LSCC 2026 Q3","e":"lscc","d":"2026-11-02","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Ford Tamer","x":"The streaming rack boot is fantastic because it allows our operators to upgrade the whole firmware at once across the whole rack, the whole pod, saving substantial time and providing tremendous consistency.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/03/lattice-lscc-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LSCC 2026 Q3","e":"lscc","d":"2026-11-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ford Tamer","x":"Our Compute & Communications segment delivered record revenue, up 132% year-over-year, driven by rapid adoption in data center AI applications.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/03/lattice-lscc-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LSCC 2026 Q3","e":"lscc","d":"2026-11-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ford Tamer","x":"This growing demand reflects AI infrastructure investment, more server deployments for agentic inference, and increasing AI content per server.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/03/lattice-lscc-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LSCC 2026 Q3","e":"lscc","d":"2026-11-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ford Tamer","x":"Number two, on the pricing question, we have some cost increases coming to us from our suppliers, as well as exp